{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"rows\": [\n    {\n      \"form\": \"连贯\",\n      \"text\": \"轻松过后，他忽然想到自己需要对方，对方有时也需要他；即使对方不需要他，他仍愿意陪着，不再藏着喜欢，像终于能说：“这是我的感情，我不再为它道歉。”\",\n      \"keys\": [\"不再为它道歉\"],\n      \"emotion\": \"亲密\",\n      \"from\": [\"S11-1\", \"S11-B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"form\": \"连贯\",\n      \"text\": \"这个念头一上来，他高兴得连害臊都顾不上，觉得自己这么在乎对方也没什么不好；刚才还近乎失重、像在梦里漂着，可此刻仿佛还是同一艘船、同一首歌，却忽然变得异常直接、异常现实。\",\n      \"keys\": [\"异常直接、异常现实\"],\n      \"emotion\": \"欢喜\",\n      \"from\": [\"S11-2\", \"S11-B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"form\": \"连贯\",\n      \"text\": \"可对方以后还愿不愿意让他陪在身边，不是他能说了算的；想到两人未必总能这样亲近，欢喜浓烈得身体几乎承受不住，胸口非但没舒展开，反而被压得发痛；久悬的期待似乎终于得到某种满足，但全曲还没结束。\",\n      \"keys\": [\"被压得发痛\"],\n      \"emotion\": \"悬着\",\n      \"from\": [\"S11-3\", \"S11-B2\", \"S11-B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"form\": \"散落\",\n      \"items\": [\n        {\n          \"text\": \"像夕阳沉下前一两分钟\",\n          \"from\": [\"S11-B3\"],\n          \"bars\": \"84–92\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"血红金亮，刺眼想流泪\",\n          \"from\": [\"S11-B3\"],\n          \"bars\": \"84–92\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"像多年后再走进旧房子\",\n          \"from\": [\"S11-B4\"],\n          \"bars\": \"84–92\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"家具可能没变\",\n          \"from\": [\"S11-B4\"],\n          \"bars\": \"84–92\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"可你知道的事情太多\",\n          \"from\": [\"S11-B4\"],\n          \"bars\": \"84–92\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"温柔重现，却有新重量\",\n          \"from\": [\"S11-B4\"],\n          \"bars\": \"84–92\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"text\": \"知道它珍贵后更容易疼\",\n          \"from\": [\"S11-B4\"],\n          \"bars\": \"84–92\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"notes\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"主题回归，开头旋律不再谨慎收弱\",\n      \"bars\": \"84–84\",\n      \"from\": [\"S11-B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"厚重和弦托起歌声\",\n      \"bars\": \"84–92\",\n      \"from\": [\"S11-B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"左手温柔水波翻作跨数个八度的惊涛骇浪\",\n      \"bars\": \"84–92\",\n      \"from\": [\"S11-B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"铺开的力量仿佛悬空\",\n      \"bars\": \"92–92\",\n      \"from\": [\"S11-B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"像在等待下一股更大的浪潮\",\n      \"bars\": \"92–92\",\n      \"from\": [\"S11-B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"若还记得第32小节那次\",\n      \"bars\": \"92–92\",\n      \"from\": [\"S11-B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"差点抵达却没能真正落定的高潮\",\n      \"bars\": \"92–92\",\n      \"from\": [\"S11-B2\"]\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6bddf8d5-ea6d-4021-aa87-53f50fd1df11", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261109T223227114505Z", "elapsed_seconds": 627.078, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T22:42:54.203760+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ed60f82d487b8cdf1d378d69cb295f83d12d0778cf6d952fcf645b71bc95ad6d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9